<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main id="main">
  <%- include('partials/page-hero', {
        crumbs: [{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Terms of Service', url: '/terms' }],
        heroTitle: 'Terms of Service',
        heroText: 'The terms that govern the use of this website and the services we provide.'
      }) %>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <div class="prose">
        <p><em>Last updated: <%= fmtDate(new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]) %></em></p>

        <h2>1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using this website you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not
          use the site. The site is operated by <%= site.legalName %>.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Information on this website</h2>
        <p>
          Content on this website — including service descriptions, guides, blog articles and pricing indications —
          is provided for general information only. Indicative prices are starting points and are not a quotation.
          A binding price is only established in a written, signed proposal following an on-site inspection.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Estimates and quotations</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>All estimates are free and carry no obligation.</li>
          <li>Written quotations are valid for the period stated on the quotation.</li>
          <li>Quotations assume the scope described at inspection; unforeseen conditions (such as concealed decking damage) may require a written variation agreed with you before work proceeds.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Scheduling and access</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to provide safe and reasonable access to the property for inspection and works. Timelines are
          given in good faith but may be affected by weather, material availability and site conditions.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          We provide a workmanship warranty as stated in your contract, in addition to any manufacturer’s material
          warranty. Warranties do not cover damage caused by storms, impact, third-party work, structural movement,
          lack of maintenance, or alterations made by others after completion.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Payments</h2>
        <p>
          Payment terms are set out in your written contract. Deposits may be required to schedule work and to order
          materials. Invoices are payable in accordance with the terms stated on the invoice.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, <%= site.name %> shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental
          or consequential loss arising from the use of this website or from information published on it. Nothing in
          these terms limits liability that cannot lawfully be limited.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos and images, is owned by or licensed to
          <%= site.name %> and may not be reproduced without written permission.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          This website may contain links to third-party sites. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy or
          practices of those sites.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of the State of <%= site.address.regionName %>, United States, and any
          dispute shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of that state.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a> or call
          <a href="tel:<%= site.phoneHref %>"><%= site.phone %></a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/cta') %>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
